{"asset_key":"ep7/gameplay_story_17600070","episode":"ep7","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"17600070","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1760007001:0":{"text":"さすがは、あたしが見込んだ新世代ね！本当に見事な戦いだったわ！","source_cn":"不愧是我看好的新生代，为我们献上了一场精彩绝伦的战斗！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90A7BEA288635E6E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1760007002:0":{"text":"それでは、勝者から一言どうぞ――","source_cn":"那么，有请我们的胜者发言——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6EB3E84E0F58C122","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1760007003:0":{"text":"ぼくが勝ったんだから、お願いごとを聞いてくれるよね！","source_cn":"我赢了，现在实现我之前许下的愿望吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7DB28AAD618B0B5B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1760007004:0":{"text":"あはっ、とっても素直でまっすぐな性格の勇者さんね！","source_cn":"哈哈，这位小勇士的性格还真是直接呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25AEBD7823D3ABBC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1760007005:0":{"text":"人探しをしてほしいのよね？任せて。あたしはできない約束はしないわ！","source_cn":"你想找人对吧？放心吧，我曼卡拉说到做到！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34DF861F699C3222","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1760007006:0":{"text":"あなたの願いを叶えてくれそうな人を呼んでおいたの。それは――占い師のサテラよ！","source_cn":"看，我已经帮你找到能实现愿望的人选啦！她就是——占卜师...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29DB9D4BC0F2794C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1760007007:0":{"text":"お久しぶり、<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>さん！","source_cn":"嗨，<style=stress><player_nam...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x348B8334F48D1308","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"お久しぶり、<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>さん！","female":"お久しぶり、<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>さん！","variant_male_record_index":"236732","variant_female_record_index":"236733","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1760007008:0":{"text":"探し人の特徴を教えて。イグナイトが君たちを導いてくれるわ！","source_cn":"请向我描述一下那个人的长相和特征，炎晶之眼会为你们提供指引！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2CC892213F30D3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:16:1760007009:0":{"text":"ヤマトはサテラに、ガブモンの特徴を事細かく伝えた……","source_cn":"大和详细谨慎、事无巨细地向萨忒娜描述了加布兽……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C41743F0FA2505E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1760007010:1":{"text":"とっても可愛らしい子なのね。分かった、あたしに任せて！","source_cn":"听上去是很可爱的小家伙呢。好，交给我吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F1A096D43163735","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1760007011:1":{"text":"時の流れを遡り、世俗の壁を乗り越え……迷える者を探したまえ……","source_cn":"上溯时光之流，超脱世俗的迷障……追寻迷途者的踪迹……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x008FD01D361C10F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1760007012:1":{"text":"見えた！これは……空に漂う無数の本、広々とした湖、濃密な魔力の気配……それから、不気味な墓地……本を抱えて授業を受ける人たち……","source_cn":"啊！我看到了……漂浮的群书，广袤的湖泊，丰盈的魔力气息...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3CD0A2F28E043DD5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1760007013:1":{"text":"あたしに見えたのはこれが全部よ。どう？何か思い当たることがある？","source_cn":"我能看到的只有这些了。怎么样，有头绪了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE877A7A5465D0223","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:21:1760007013":{"text":"あたしに見えたのはこれが全部よ。どう？何か思い当たることがある？","source_cn":"我能看到的只有这些了。怎么样，有头绪了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE877A7A5465D0223","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1760007014:1":{"text":"レヒラム？それはどこだ？","source_cn":"莱希拉姆……那是哪里？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFD392DB97772F1A6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"レヒラム？それはどこだ？","female":"レヒラム？それはどこだ？","variant_male_record_index":"236740","variant